1. Added all the necessary provider imports
2. Created a QueryClient instance
3. Added mock session data for SessionProvider
4. Created a basic i18n instance mock
5. Wrapped the ImportedComponent with all the required providers in the correct order based on the component stack
6. Maintained the existing state management with useParentState

This should resolve the provider-related errors. If you encounter any specific provider initialization errors, we may need to adjust the mock data or provider configurations accordingly.

